,"status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p020","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue"}],"relations":[{"id":"a-jin055-volume-yue-mother","subject_person_id":"d2b_1d3_333","object_person_id":"ijy_c82_1s4","predicate":"mother","qualifiers":{"source_term":"其母數誚之"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-055","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue","source_id":"s-jinshu-055-pan-yue-ws2316433","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p014","quote":"岳性輕躁，趨世利，與石崇等諂事賈謐，每候其出，與崇輒望塵而拜。構湣懷之文，岳之辭也。謐二十四友，岳為其首。謐《晉書》限斷，亦岳之辭也。其母數誚之曰：「爾當知足，而幹沒不已乎？」而岳終不能改。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p014:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p014:m0068"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"本傳親稱具在，母名不詳。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-055-pan-yue:p013","text":"岳頻宰二邑，勤於政績。調補尚書度支郎，遷廷尉評，以公事免。楊駿輔政，高選吏佐，引岳為太傅主簿。駿誅，除名。初，譙人公孫宏少孤貧，客田于河陽，善鼓琴，頗能屬文。岳之為河陽令，愛其才藝，待之甚厚。至是，宏為楚王瑋長史，專殺生之政。時駿綱紀皆當從坐，同署主簿硃振已就戮。岳其夕取急在外，宏言之瑋，謂之假吏，故得免。未幾，選為長安令，作《西征賦》，述所經人物山水，文清旨詣，辭多不錄。征補博士，未召，以母疾輒去，官免。尋為著作郎，轉散騎侍郎，遷給事黃門侍郎。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":82,"last_line":82,"raw_start":6709,"raw_end":6934,"raw_character_offsets":[6709,6710,6711,6712,6713,6714,6715,6716,6717,6718,6719,6720,6721,6722,6723,6724,6725,6726,6727,6728,6729,6730,6731,6732,6733,6734,6735,6736,6737,6738,6739,6740,6741,6742,6743,6744,6745,6746,6747,6748,6749,6750,6751,6752,6753,6754,6755,6756,6757,6758,6759,6760,6761,6762,6763,6764,6765,6766,6767,6768,6769,6770,6771,6772,6773,6774,6775,6776,6777,6778,6779,6780,6781,6782,6783,6784,6785,6786,6787,6788,6789,6790,6791,6792,6793,6794,6795,6796,6797,6798,6799,6800,6801,6802,6803,6804,6805,6806,6807,6808,6809,681